# Manuscripts and private sample Books remain local-only. Document formats
# are ignored everywhere by default. ADR 0043, as narrowed by ADR 0079 §5,
# admits under exact-root SampleBooks/ only exact `sample1.docx` beside this
# directory's README; placement alone is never admission. The five former
# SampleBooks are local-only test material and are refused by name below.
*.doc
*.docx
*.odt
*.rtf
*.pdf
/SampleBooks/*
!/SampleBooks/README.md
!/SampleBooks/sample1.docx
/SampleBooks/1蟠虺（修订290326字).docx
/SampleBooks/2听漏（定稿368544字）.docx
/SampleBooks/3天兽（定稿395870字)##＊.doc
/SampleBooks/春歌(一次通读后电子版).pdf
/SampleBooks/蟠虺.docx

# Local secrets and credential material never enter the repository.
.env
*.key
*.pem

# Generated dependencies, builds, caches, business stores, and diagnostics.
node_modules/
dist/
.cache/
.runtime/
.pnpm-store/
test-results/
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
*.db-*
*.key.txt
